Runs 2 and 3 of the T030o39/T030o40 mutation matrix were STOPPED by the invoker before completion (no .rc exists) because the code under test changed after independent-review passes 2 and 3: run 2 tested the git-derived anchor that R1/R2 replaced, run 3 the fold probe that T1/T2 corrected. Their lines are evidence of what ran, not results for the final code. Run 4 is the matrix of record.
